---
intent: >
  Repoint provisionBrain from the retired `playbookHub`/`researchHub`
  field names on `ParseBrainAideResult.ok` to the marker-pair-cycle
  renamed fields `playbook` and `research`. Update the orchestrator's
  `resolveBrainAideBody` helper return shape to `{ playbook, research }`.
  Rename the helpers and step names to drop the retired `hub` token
  (`buildPlaybookHubStep` → `buildPlaybookStep`,
  `buildResearchHubStep` → `buildResearchStep`, step names
  `"Playbook hub"` / `"Research hub"` → `"Playbook entry-point"` /
  `"Research entry-point"`). Repoint test fixtures and assertions
  accordingly. The 5-step pipeline shape is preserved verbatim
  (brain config → brain root directories → playbook entry-point
  artifact → research entry-point artifact → MCP entry); only the
  field names destructured from the parser result, the helper and
  step-name vocabulary, and the in-line test fixture body grammar
  change.
---

## Project Structure

This is an edit plan against an existing module. The folder shape and
the orchestrator's external signature are unchanged. What changes:

- `index.ts`: every reference to the retired `playbookHub` /
  `researchHub` field names on the parser result is renamed to
  `playbook` / `research`. The `resolveBrainAideBody` helper's
  return type changes from `{ playbookHub: string; researchHub:
  string } | null` to `{ playbook: string; research: string } |
  null`. Helper names and step names drop the retired `hub` token.
- `index.test.ts`: every assertion on the retired field names is
  renamed. In-line brain.aide fixture strings switch from the
  retired `## Prose` / `## Playbook hub` / `## Research hub`
  heading grammar to the marker-pair grammar
  (`<!-- aide-prose-start -->` etc.) so the parser they exercise
  succeeds. Step-name assertions (`"Playbook hub"` →
  `"Playbook entry-point"`, `"Research hub"` →
  `"Research entry-point"`) update to the new vocabulary.

```
src/service/install/provisionBrain/
├── .aide                         ← [existing, aligned] intent spec —
│                                    already rewritten for the
│                                    marker-pair grammar, the renamed
│                                    `playbook`/`research` fields, and
│                                    the storage-agnostic
│                                    "entry-point artifact" vocabulary
├── plan.aide                     ← [this file, REPLACES the prior
│                                    8/8-done plan that targeted the
│                                    retired `playbookHub`/`researchHub`
│                                    field names]
├── todo.aide                     ← [existing] alignment record (untouched)
├── index.ts                      ← [edit] orchestrator + helpers
│                                    export default async function provisionBrain(
│                                      projectRoot: string,
│                                      brainPath: string,
│                                      mcpConfigPath: string,
│                                    ): Promise<InitStep[]>
│                                    signature unchanged. 5-step pipeline
│                                    preserved verbatim. Behavior changes:
│                                      - resolveBrainAideBody returns
│                                        `{ playbook, research } | null`
│                                        (was `{ playbookHub, researchHub }`)
│                                      - destructure of parseBrainAide /
│                                        parseBrainAideFromString result
│                                        uses `parseResult.playbook` and
│                                        `parseResult.research`
│                                      - buildPlaybookHubStep →
│                                        buildPlaybookStep
│                                      - buildResearchHubStep →
│                                        buildResearchStep
│                                      - InitStep.name field on those
│                                        two steps changes from
│                                        `"Playbook hub"` →
│                                        `"Playbook entry-point"` and
│                                        `"Research hub"` →
│                                        `"Research entry-point"`
│                                      - `body.playbookHub` consumer
│                                        becomes `body.playbook`;
│                                        `body.researchHub` becomes
│                                        `body.research`
│                                      - JSDoc identifier sweep: every
│                                        remaining occurrence of `hub`
│                                        in JSDoc, comments, log strings,
│                                        and identifier names is rewritten
│                                        to `entry-point` /
│                                        `entry-point artifact`
├── index.test.ts                 ← [edit] tests reflect the renamed
